<%- include("partials/head") %>
<%- include("partials/navbar") %>

<main id="main-content" class="section-space about-page">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="row align-items-center g-5 mb-5" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE MINDSET BEHIND THE NAME</p>
        <h1 id="about-title" class="section-title">
          Strength is built.<br>
          Culture is shared.
        </h1>

        <p class="about-lead">
          Iron Culture is for people who keep showing up.
          The early starts. The steady sessions. The decision to put
          in the work, even when motivation runs low.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our name brings together two ideas. Iron represents the
          resistance we train against and the strength we work towards.
          Culture represents the habits, encouragement and shared
          commitment that keep us moving forward.
        </p>

        <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-brand mt-3">
          Explore the Store
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="about-emblem">
          <img
            src="/images/logo.png"
            alt="Iron Culture Spartan helmet emblem"
            width="1254"
            height="1254"
          >
          <p>DISCIPLINE. CONSISTENCY. PROGRESS.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story mb-5" aria-labelledby="spartan-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR SPARTAN IDENTITY</p>
      <h2 id="spartan-title" class="h2">A symbol of commitment.</h2>

      <p>
        Our Spartan emblem expresses the mindset we want Iron Culture
        to stand for: focus, resilience and the courage to keep going.
        It is a reminder that progress takes preparation and repeated effort.
      </p>

      <p class="mb-0">
        You do not need to be the strongest person in the room to belong.
        Whether you are finding your rhythm or pursuing your next personal
        best, there is value in showing up and building from where you are.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5" aria-labelledby="values-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE STAND FOR</p>
      <h2 id="values-title" class="h2 mb-4">The habits behind the strength.</h2>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="about-value h-100">
            <span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Discipline</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Make time for the work. Build routines you can return to
              and take ownership of the effort you put in.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="about-value h-100">
            <span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Consistency</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Progress grows through repeated effort. Train with purpose,
              make room for recovery and keep building over time.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="about-value h-100">
            <span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <h3 class="h5">Community</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Respect different starting points. Encourage the person
              beside you and celebrate the work behind their progress.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="training-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">FUEL YOUR NEXT LEVEL</p>
      <h2 id="training-title" class="h2">Bring your goals. Build your routine.</h2>

      <p>
        Explore our supplement range online or visit our store in Ficksburg.
        We offer nationwide delivery across South Africa, bringing Iron
        Culture to wherever you train.
      </p>

      <p>
        Supplements are one part of a training routine. Consistent effort,
        balanced nutrition and recovery remain its foundation.
      </p>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">
        <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-brand">Shop Supplements</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
<%- include("partials/scripts") %>